@kira905/dsh-session-title-live README · 11. Related components：> There are **no code dependencies** between these components and they share no runtime — they point at each other because they answer the same batch of questions
> for the same kind of person (running an agent on your own machine for months: install it, find it, see it, diagnose it). Installing one does not affect the others.

